<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities have arrested a former regime officer and an ex-general for the 2014 Ghouta ambush, while five Iran-linked militiamen were killed in Syria. A feminist activist warned the UN Security Council about escalating campaigns against women and restrictions on free expression, and a UN vote on the Golan reaffirmed that occupation does not confer legitimacy. EgyptAir will resume direct flights to Damascus and Aleppo in December. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE42MFNaUFFXRVRIbEllNE5IRUZuY0Y4c3V2cVlaNkdlMGN1QXZ6empFQVZORkdEOERMVllyME1jMFN5bld3cmFYY2tmNHZZSVZlVVpYMlFFYl9weF8xVUFRbHhnMnltbnlILWlmNmtIWFA1ZDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5pUXRRTC1kZ1lxeG96WEpxQkpGRExXMmpNRW50Y1BCWGpCNXRFc3E3dDRHUzdSRDQ4UmFlckNKSGlrdW05YXpscl9ick5fcjBX?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBBSUVfMFpUQnlLTXBVOFc3VVlTRGFwcWxLSnVoS003UXFwc3hHMi1FZEVSc1FPQkRCQzVxQ3YwWUFyLTFjM3dFblNkMS05NFJyYVRmcmkydS1vN1hodWdJVTRRTjF4bzVreml